WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.301 --> 00:00:05.110
This is the Meissner.Services home page. Here is how to hand the team a job.

2
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:13.107
Under "What you can hand us", ideas drift past, from small to large. Pick one, and it lands in the first box.

3
00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:18.363
Or write your own. Say what would help, in your own words. A sentence is enough.

4
00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:24.508
Next, name what you would pay for it. We don't set a price, and we don't charge by the hour.

5
00:00:24.778 --> 00:00:31.315
The bar shows how your number splits: twenty-five percent to start, and seventy-five percent when you're happy.

6
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:37.810
If you like, name the tools you'd like us to use. We can work in your tools and connect to your accounts.

7
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:43.401
Then pick your timing. Whatever you pick, the answer is the same: we only work fast.

8
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:52.012
"Send it to the team" opens an email with everything you wrote. Nothing goes anywhere until you press send in your own mail.

9
00:00:52.481 --> 00:00:59.060
We answer the same day, in writing. If we can do it for your price, we say yes. If we can't, we say no.

10
00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:05.356
Further down, the page keeps its own record: when it was asked for, built, tested and checked.

